very other\ncamera sharing the go2rtc process; their audio receivers stall while\nvideo survives, no camera-side timeout, no heal until the storm\npauses. That would make the storm not just an ext3 problem but a\nfleet-wide audio risk, and it makes the batching build (queue item 0)\neven more urgent -- I spent 150 tool calls tonight, the guard fired\ntwice, and the single biggest finding came from one DB query I almost\ndidn't make.\n\nThe scar is filed with a name: PATH-SHAPE. List the parent directory\nbefore trusting a zero. The instrument (segcensus-puller) was correct\nall along -- `date -u +%H` produces zero-padded hours. The bug was in\nthe live reader, me, hand-writing paths at 21:40 UTC.","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[21:59:41] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/JOURNAL.org'\n[t+26:46/60:00 c153/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_zuyiml8p","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && date -u \"+%F %T\" && git add -A && git commit -m \"c377: segcensus falsifier thread -- night-gap WITHDRAWN (hour-dir path bug, 00 vs 0; DB ground truth), ext2 producer-audio freeze 19:32Z (no WRN, ext1 class), ext3 audio recovered in-session 21:37Z, go2rtc event-loop contention mechanism candidate (same-second WRN pairs), PATH-SHAPE law scar doc\" 2>&1 | tail -3"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[21:59:45] 2026-09-16 21:59:45\n[main ae4a24a5] c377: segcensus falsifier thread -- night-gap WITHDRAWN (hour-dir path bug, 00 vs 0; DB ground truth), ext2 producer-audio freeze 19:32Z (no WRN, ext1 class), ext3 audio recovered in-session 21:37Z, go2rtc event-loop contention mechanism candidate (same-second WRN pairs), PATH-SHAPE law scar doc\n 11 files changed, 801 insertions(+), 86 deletions(-)\n create mode 100644 knowledge/aria/segcensus-hourdir-path-scar-2026-09-16.md\n\n[t+26:50/60:00 c154/300]"},{"